Kind: ablation
Issue: #771
Takes out: thread_begin_trampoline's panic that names a continuation that returns -- falling out, the thread reaches context_thread_start's own panic, which says only that "a thread function" returned, and cont-return-check.sh reads that as WRONG
Accel: tcg,kvm
Script: scripts/cont-return-boot.sh
Expect: cont-return-check: WRONG

diff --git a/uros/src/mach_kernel/x86_64/thread/machine.c b/uros/src/mach_kernel/x86_64/thread/machine.c
